  "scope": [
    "Four serial ABBA fresh full source-to-Object observations. No builds, tests, fixtures, CPU profiles or archiving overlap primary timing. Bootstrap and the separate screen are excluded.",
    "Same 54 existing runtime flags and host process statistics for both frozen subjects; current runtime flag discovery comes from the rejected SSA packet, whose 53-flag screens are not pooled.",
    "The prior provisional SSA construction candidate was reverted. Control production source is identical to this trial base, and exact output identity includes its previously qualified fast 54-flag Object.",
